---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section class="final-cta px-6 relative isolate overflow-hidden text-center pt-25 pb-28 [&_>_div]:relative [&_>_div]:z-1 [&_h2]:text-7xl [&_h2]:leading-none [&_.eyebrow]:text-xs [&_p:not(.eyebrow)]:text-sm [&_p:not(.eyebrow)]:mb-7 max-sm:px-5 max-sm:pt-16 max-sm:pb-20 max-sm:[&_h2]:text-4xl max-sm:[&_.eyebrow]:text-xs max-sm:[&_.eyebrow]:tracking-widest max-sm:[&_p:not(.eyebrow)]:text-xs">
  <span
    class="cta-watermark absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 font-serif text-9xl leading-none tracking-tighter text-accent/40 whitespace-nowrap -z-1 max-sm:text-6xl max-sm:top-1/2"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    FRISSON
  </span>
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow text-xs font-medium tracking-widest leading-relaxed mb-6 text-olive max-sm:text-xs max-sm:mb-4 max-sm:tracking-widest">
      HAY GESTOS QUE SE QUEDAN PARA SIEMPRE
    </p>
    <h2>
      Regala una emoción.
      <br />
      <em>Crea un recuerdo.</em>
    </h2>
    <p>Una manera diferente de expresar lo que sientes.</p>
    <a
      href="/catalogo"
      class="button button-dark py-3 px-7 border border-solid border-olive gap-6 inline-flex justify-center items-center min-h-12 rounded-full bg-olive bg-none text-xs font-medium leading-normal transition duration-300 ease-out whitespace-nowrap text-paper [&:hover]:border-ink [&:hover]:bg-ink [&:hover]:bg-none [&:hover]:text-paper [&:hover]:-translate-y-0.5 max-sm:px-6 max-sm:min-h-11 max-sm:text-xs"
    >
      Descubrir Frisson <Icon name="arrow" size="sm" />
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
